    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85903" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσῐδήϊος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ion.
		 for <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσιδεῖος</span></b>  (v.
		infr.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Π. ἄλσος</span> the grove <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sacred to Poseidon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.506
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				230
			</span></i>; written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσείδιον</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλσος</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.3.20
			</span></i>; but the 
				Att.
			 form is <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσῐδεῖος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				506
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσῐδάϊος</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ]</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
				ὁ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), a month
			at Epidaurus, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).103.35
			</span></i>; Hellenistic <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσῐδεῖος</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				6850
			</span></i> (incert. loc.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσῐδήϊον</span></b> , τό, 
				Ion.
			 for <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσῐδεῖον</span></b> 
			(which is found in <i>Inscr.Dėlos</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				372
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				158
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii/ii B.C.)</span>), <i>temple of Poseidon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.266
			</span></i>; written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσείδιον</span></b> 
			in <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.34.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσῐδεῖα</span></b> , τά, <i>festival of Poseidon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).203
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				287
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				89
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i>Inscr.Dėlos</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				372
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				114
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii/ii B.C.)</span>; written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσῐδέα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.190.8
			</span></i>.</div>
